# (c) The timer fires but context is under 120k: skip.
title:   A small context is left alone
caption: The timer fires as usual, but the context holds only 64k tokens, below minTokens. Re-reading it would be cheap, so the mod skips the compact and the conversation stays exactly as it was.
note:    1 column = 1 minute. Set minTokens to 0 to always compact.
focus:   s

time        0    5m   10m  15m  20m
claude   -S~E-------------------------
timer       [===================F
compact  ------------------------s----

legend
S  turn.start      blue
~  turn            teal
E  turn.complete — arms the timer  teal
=  idle timer · 20 min  violet
F  timer fires — context 64k  violet
s  skip — 64k < 120k  amber
